<title>HONG KONG: Cathay Pacific Oct traffic and capacity.</title>
<headline>Cathay Pacific Oct traffic and capacity.</headline>
<text>
<p>HONG KONG, Dec 11 - (Reuter) The following are the latest traffic and capacity statistics for October published by Cathay Pacific Airways Limited. They include passengers and freight carried as well as load factors.</p>
<p>TRAFFIC		 Oct 96    Sept 96  Cumulative Cumulative   Change</p>
<p>						   Jan-Oct 96 Jan-Oct 95</p>
<p>Pax carried	   910,520   834,262   9,146,900 8,586,711   +6.5pct</p>
<p>Freight (000kgs)     55,877    50,067     465,783   436,628   +6.7</p>
<p>Pax load factor	 72pct     70pct	 74pct     72pct   +2.1</p>
<p>Cargo load factor     73pct     70pct	 65pct     66pct   -0.7</p>
<p>Number of flights     1,838     1,777	18,048    17,049   +5.9</p>
<p>CAPACITY		Oct 96    Sept 96   Cumulative  Cumulative Change</p>
<p>						    Jan-Oct 96  Jan-Oct 95</p>
<p>Avail tonne-km(000)   918,744   889,112  8,314,785   7,343,459 +13.2pct Avail seat-km(000)  4,766,307 4,651,252 44,897,671  40,730,798 +10.2</p>
<p>Revenue pax-km(000) 3,452,599 3,256,948 33,195,340  29,238,891 +13.5</p>
<p>Avail cargo(000)	459,904   441,587  3,990,278   3,421,473 +16.6</p>
<p>Cargo tonne-km(000)   336,140   307,080  2,608,432   2,260,885 +15.4</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
